# REST

## Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}

## Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "confirmPassword": ""
}

## Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

## Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN